#: environments/atmospheric_1928.env.json
msgid "A picture palace built as a Mediterranean courtyard at dusk: lit windows, iron balconies, a palace gate with an organ, a crescent moon and real stars."
msgstr ""

#: environments/bathysphere.env.json
msgid "A glass dome on the sea floor: kelp and coral in the floodlights, schools of fish, glowing creatures drawn to the screen, a manta overhead, and in a quiet scene now and then a whale."
msgstr ""

#: environments/cinema.env.json
msgid "The converted cinema: rows on a rake, curtains that part when the film starts, and the house lights going down."
msgstr ""

#: environments/crater.env.json
msgid "A Moon base's cinema under a geodesic glass dome: Earth turns slowly over the screen, the crater's peaks catch the sun, and the Milky Way comes out when the lights go down."
msgstr ""

#: environments/drive_in_1958.env.json
msgid "A drive-in lot at dusk, seen from a convertible's bench seat: the stars come out over the film, moths in the beam, mesas on the horizon."
msgstr ""

#: environments/flagship.env.json
msgid "A big modern cinema: a steep rake, folded acoustic walls washed in amber, recliners, a starlit ceiling of baffles and a huge curved screen in velvet."
msgstr ""

#: environments/ice_cinema.env.json
msgid "An ice hotel's cinema of sawn blocks and carvings under an ice vault: candles glowing inside the ice, hides on ice benches, the polar night and the northern lights outside."
msgstr ""

#: environments/nave.env.json
msgid "A Gothic nave at night, the screen in the chancel: piers rising into rib vaults, candles on iron stands and coronae, coloured glass and a rose window in the moonlight."
msgstr ""

#: environments/palace_of_culture_1974.env.json
msgid "A palace of culture, 1974: board-marked concrete, two great mosaics that glitter in the screen's light, a field of glowing globes, and snow falling through the open roof."
msgstr ""

#: environments/pillow_fort_1993.env.json
msgid "A pillow fort in a bedroom, 1993: cushions and a bedsheet, fairy lights, rain on the window, and the telly filling the opening."
msgstr ""

#: environments/pink_palace.env.json
msgid "A dream palace in sugared almond colours: inside a great shell, its ribs glowing pink and blue round a sunburst dome, scalloped arches, mirrors, a buttoned balcony, a festoon with a gold fringe."
msgstr ""

#: environments/reclaimed.env.json
msgid "An old picture house taken back by nature: half its roof gone to the stars, ivy and ferns, rain into a puddle that gives back the film."
msgstr ""

#: environments/rooftop_athens.env.json
msgid "A summer cinema on an Athens roof: director's chairs on terracotta tiles, bougainvillea, strings of bulbs, the picture painted on a blind wall, a floodlit temple on its hill, the city all round."
msgstr ""

#: environments/screen_3_1983.env.json
msgid "A tired multiplex screen, 1983: plasterboard, a swirly carpet, a broken seat, smoke in the beam and a worn print."
msgstr ""

#: environments/screening_room_1962.env.json
msgid "A collector's private cinema in the hills, 1962: walnut and brass, a slow fire on a floating hearth, the pool glowing outside the glass, the city's lights below, a painting that rises off the screen."
